SUMMARY:⏰ 08:05 queue routine (devonstpoker-3-day-schedule)
DESCRIPTION:Morning routine (plan section 8):\n1. Count approved clips\; if fewer than 6\, trigger Scout → Spotter → Filter → Lab for 8 more.\n2. Check the next 72h is fully booked (3 slots/day\, no two clips back to back without a text post).\n3. Draft today's text posts (P2/P4/P5) and queue them.\n4. Confirm today's reveal clip quotes the right Would You Call? post.\n5. Check every caption has: series tag\, teach line\, question\, credit name + @handle.\n6. Flag takedown requests / stream DMs to Ben immediately.\n7. Remind Ben about the reply slots (11:30 and 16:00).\n8. Rebuild + publish this calendar (calendar/build_ics.py\, publish.py\, then create_or_update_file\; see calendar/PUBLISH.md).
